<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.3 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction Tuesday of next week.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     900 million pesos  25.21 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     900 million pesos  24.39 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     900 million pesos  22.70 pct</p>
<p>    356 days     600 million pesos  20.63 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 700 million pesos worth of 728-day Bondes, and 400 million UDIs worth of 1,050-day UDI bonds.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289559</p>
</text>
